#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:5
#: 085456ed0bf540b798925792cc9f2f3b
msgid "The JSN-SR04T is an ultrasonic distance sensor. There are two versions v2.0 and v3.0. They differ in the range of action. v2.0 with a range of 25 to 450 cm. v3.0 with a range of 20 to 600 cm. Also more stable. The very short range makes it of limited use."
msgstr ""

